# ── Queues ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Redis connection for the email queue (Upstash gives a rediss:// URL).
#
# Must be set on BOTH the API host and the worker host. Set on neither and
# email is simply sent inline on the request, which is fine for local work.
# Set on the worker only and the API never queues anything, so the worker
# sits idle looking healthy — the one combination that fails silently.
REDIS_URL=
